      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but my doctor is impossible to reach and the office is closed until monday. i really dont want to wait and just keep feeling like the room is spinning every time i get out of bed. if i didnt take the full dose for a day or two i'd just be even more dizzy, right? like if i just take a little bit more than the 10mg but not quite 20mg, maybe like 15mg, would that at least be safer? i feel like i can manage it better if i just take charge of the dosage myself for a bit.",
